WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:31.450
Cosmo may have seen his mother in Commander
Camyula Lanban of the Braziller Base.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:38.000
However, Camyula was killed in
an air attack by the Buff Clan.

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:44.170
Cosmo realized he had no choice but to fight.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:02:01.390
<b>Ideon Recapture Plan</b>

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.340
Okay!

00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:07.950
It takes time to connect the energy tubes!

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:09.580
You do it, my hands are full!

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.810
If you've got time to shout, give us a hand!

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.110
I'm busy!

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.110
Me too!

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.920
The food will be loaded in two minutes!

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:18.290
We don't need this transformer!

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:19.990
The chickens!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.720
Deck! Ashura! Block that place too!

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:25.260
Shoo, shoo! Don't come here!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.420
Go over there! Over there!

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:28.600
Go on! Go into your home!

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.870
Karala! Karala Ajiba!

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:31.070
Huh? Yes?

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:34.330
No rush, but can you come
to the forest behind the bridge?

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:35.370
Me?

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:36.320
I've got to talk to you.

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:37.350
Yes.

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:38.760
Thanks.

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:51.060
Attach the Carioca!

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.170
Keep an eye on our surroundings!

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.900
The Carioca has been attached!

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:00.670
Okay!

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:02.870
Enter DS Drive for two minutes immediately!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:06.300
Later on, activate it for three hours to shake off the Buff Clan.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:20.280
How much battle strength does the enemy base possess?

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:25.580
Ma'am! Thanks to Doku's squadron, they've lost more than a third of their forces.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:28.390
Send the Gataman Zan to wipe out the rest of them!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.190
I apologize for the trouble.

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:33.250
It seems like the enemy ship has taken off.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:35.710
Doku, let's hear your strategy.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.120
Yes!

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.290
I'm certain that the Giant's power is rising.

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.670
My plan is to set a trap and take hostages.

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.240
Do you believe that will work?

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.450
Indeed.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:52.120
There must be people on board
that ship who want to return to land.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.220
It is worth an attempt.

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.530
Bes! Two minutes have gone by.

00:04:00.530 --> 00:04:02.590
Okay, DS Drive Brake!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.800
DS Drive Brake!

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:14.640
The next DS Drive will be in three hours, right?

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:15.600
Yes.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:16.370
Bes.

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.790
What is it?

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:18.790
Come here...

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.090
By studying the data on Braziller...

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:28.470
I've discovered that back on Earth, they
have completed the computer, Gloria.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:29.320
And?

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:34.190
I don't want to bring the Buff Clan to Earth,
but if we went there to use Gloria...

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:34.870
Bes!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:36.540
Do you know of Dabora Star?

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.980
It's a planet that was investigated by an
immigrant ship two years ago.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:39.740
What is it?

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.810
They're saying they'll accept us.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.280
Hold on a minute.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.430
Listen here!

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:49.570
Even if we attack the Buff Clan, it's not like we'll completely destroy them.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:54.800
Just tell me about the military installations on the Buff Clan planet so we can fight them.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.500
I understand how you feel,

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:00.290
but that's impossible with the Ideon and Solo Ship alone.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:03.770
I need to know about their military strength to judge that!

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.960
Cosmo!

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:06.760
We're having an important discussion here!

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:08.870
Bes has something
important to talk about too.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:14.930
We can't let the aliens attack Earth, which means we can't go to Earth or Dabora Star.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.070
The reason the Buff Clan are so
stubborn is because Ide is here.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.320
That's why we should go to Earth or
Dabora Star to research it.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:26.770
No! Can't we investigate the Ide
without going to Earth, Sheryl?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.680
I don't have the abilities of a computer.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.160
We have the Carioca. We could
go to Dabora Star with it.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.250
Don't jump to conclusions so quickly.

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.370
I can't approve of us going to Earth
and dropping humanity into danger.

00:05:37.370 --> 00:05:37.770
No.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.630
Shouldn't we call the Buff Clan to Earth,
and attack them with the main fleet?

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:44.120
But the Buff Clan might come
with their full battle strength.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:55.170
This is no longer a personal grudge,

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:57.720
but I need you as a hostage.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:05:58.970
Stand up!

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.820
Engine critical!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.220
I'm sorry, Karala.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:17.080
Setting the coordinates!

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.030
Right here.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:23.100
Bes is sure to come after us.

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:25.580
You're here for that time.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:27.720
I wonder about that.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.870
Why?

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:32.250
The Solo Ship doesn't need me anymore.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.530
Bes! The Carioca's launched!

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.650
Why did you let it launch!?

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:42.160
It left on its own!

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:44.400
Tell it to come back! Who's on board?

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:45.760
There's no reply!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:48.270
Ideo-Delta! Ideo-Buster! Prepare to launch!

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:51.260
Cosmo!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.760
Why were you hanging around Karala all of a sudden?

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:55.070
I'm in love with her!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.400
Tell me the truth!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.380
Set the coordinates to Dabora Star, quickly!

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:09.040
Yes!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:12.720
Before we enter DS Drive, send a
 goodbye message to the Solo Ship.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:13.850
Yes, we'll do that.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:14.760
Hey!

00:07:14.760 --> 00:07:17.250
You seem to regret this more than I expected.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:22.870
However, I'm happy to know there's that kind of side to you.

00:07:36.550 --> 00:07:38.950
A vessel has taken off from the enemy ship.

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.000
Did you get any data on it?

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:40.650
Yes.

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.740
It doesn't seem to be very well equipped.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.450
We can beat it with one of our Zigg Macks.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:50.340
Don't be careless.

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.700
We'll surround it with every unit and capture it.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.670
Hurry!

00:08:02.740 --> 00:08:04.650
There are objects approaching the Carioca!

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:06.120
Can't you get them on the screen?

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.720
They're too far away, it's impossible!

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:09.990
All Ideon units! Launch quickly!

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.020
Who are the ones running away?

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:13.860
Sheryl, Karala, Hatari and others.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.090
I knew it.

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:16.900
So whose idea was it?

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:17.760
I don't know!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.030
It was Karala's, wasn't it?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.560
Okay, head in and surround them!

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:31.870
Yes sir! Fire!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.840
B, Buff Clan?!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.310
Hatari! Can we shake them off?!

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:44.890
All gun turrets! Shoot down all the enemies you can!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:47.470
It's a Zurow Jick!

00:08:53.040 --> 00:08:54.460
They've engaged the enemy!

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:56.090
Send out the Sol Vanier! Moera!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:59.020
I'm on it! Sol Vanier, launching!

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:05.830
That Carioca...

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:07.660
Did it get captured by the Buff Clan?!

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:13.090
Doing this will only disperse our battle strength!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:15.040
Why'd they do this?

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.770
Don't aim at the bridge!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:25.220
Just smash the gun turrets!

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.270
Hatari! Can you contact the enemy?

00:09:31.270 --> 00:09:32.620
Why do you ask?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:36.300
It might be useless, but if
we tell them about Karala...

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:38.320
Understood. Here.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.470
Calling all Buff Clan units!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:44.650
We have Supreme Commander Doba's
daughter, Karala Ajiba hostage here!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:46.830
It's no use...

00:09:46.830 --> 00:09:48.110
Don't move!

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:49.430
Please respond!

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.610
We're holding Karala Ajiba hostage!

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:56.450
Sir Doku, is this alright?

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.400
They are holding Lady Karala hostage.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:02.850
Lady Harulu told us to contact them if they open a communication circuit.

00:10:02.850 --> 00:10:04.420
Tell them to surrender!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.010
We've been caught!

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:21.010
Lady Karala, I've been told that
I can do with you as I please!

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:24.240
We'll be taking you all hostage.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:29.580
Did you really believe that
Dabora Star would let you land?

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.330
Dabora Star's message...

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:32.980
It was a trap?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.080
Ms. Sheryl...

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:40.030
We're going to be hostages!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:41.530
Okay!

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:44.910
We'll use the Logo Dau aliens as hostages
and exchange them for the Giant.

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.010
Head for the enemy mothership!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.520
To the left at
two o'clock! Is that the Carioca?!

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.190
Kasha! Follow me!

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.590
That Karala!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:06.990
Did she run away because of what I said to her?

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.890
The Giant machines are approaching.

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:14.500
Good!

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:16.450
Tune the radio circuits!

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:21.380
Techno! The Buff Clan has the Carioca!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:22.440
This is bad!

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:24.230
They've been taken hostage?

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:28.570
They gave into Karala's threats and escaped! Does it matter what happens to them?

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:31.010
Listen to me! Logo Dau aliens!

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:33.250
Logo Dau aliens?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.490
We've captured your comrades.

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:41.500
If you want to save them, hand over
the three Giant machines to us.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:46.290
If you accept these conditions,
our side will withdraw at once.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.890
Are you kidding me!?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:50.490
They want to exchange Sheryl and Karala?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:52.780
Give me your answer within ten minutes!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:56.440
But if you try to dock and form
the Giant before then...

00:11:56.440 --> 00:11:59.250
I'll crush your friends!

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:17.220
The Buff Clan is such a cruel race!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:21.020
This is how you threaten people.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.880
I don't want to die like this!

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:25.940
Sheryl!

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.530
Are we going to give them the Ideon?

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:36.290
No.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.620
We can't do that.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.420
Well, let's just beat them!

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:42.110
No, we can't do that either.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.580
They've got Sheryl and Karala.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:47.230
Huh? Who is that?

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:49.700
This is footage from the Ideo-Delta.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.220
Don't you know who it is?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:52.200
No, we don't!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:53.600
Could that be Karala?

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:54.740
No way!

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.420
Karala's from the Buff Clan, isn't she?

00:12:56.420 --> 00:13:00.690
And she threatened
everyone and fled from the Solo Ship, right?

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:03.390
Ah, that's right. Makes sense...

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.070
What now?

00:13:12.050 --> 00:13:14.230
They're monitoring our communications.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.890
So we can only talk directly like this, right?

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.100
Let's just attack!

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.280
We can't!

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:22.780
I want to save Sheryl to make her indebted to us.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:24.240
Indebted?

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:27.840
She's the most eager to flee from the Solo Ship.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.610
If we can make her stay, it'll speed up the research on Ide.

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:31.740
What are we going do?

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:34.410
We'll send out one machine at a time and get the hostages.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:35.710
After that, we'll dock.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:37.790
Is that even possible?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.190
There's a way to pull it off using our spacesuits.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.420
If we dock, we can reach the cockpits...

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.980
of Ideo-Delta and Nova from the Ideo-Buster.

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:47.650
There's no time to waste, let's do it!

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:53.530
It's always the most dangerous way with him!

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:00.230
Do you really want to see the hostages die?

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.130
Or will you hand over the Giant machines?

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:03.660
You have ten seconds!

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:07.200
We'll hand over the Giant
 machine, Ideon, to you!

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:10.050
What?! You've made your decision?

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.120
Send all of your crew out! We're coming get them!

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.020
No!

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.070
First we'll transform one machine and send it out.

00:14:15.070 --> 00:14:18.080
In exchange for that, release one of the people held by the ship.

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:20.200
That's what he wants?

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:21.490
How shrewd.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.400
All right, move forward.

00:14:23.400 --> 00:14:25.260
If you do so, we'll release both hostages.

00:14:25.260 --> 00:14:27.010
Roger. Here I come!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:35.960
We've moved!

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:38.600
Can you see that both the pilot
and the gunner have gotten out?

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:43.610
You're visible on the long-distance camera. We're releasing the hostages, understood?

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:45.380
One,

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.150
two,

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:46.960
three!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.060
Next, give us the other two simultaneously!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.450
Then we'll release your ship!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.350
Roger!

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.230
Moera!

00:14:58.230 --> 00:14:59.550
I promise!

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:01.080
Garaba! Get in front!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.210
Take in the Giant!

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.180
Roger!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.290
Kasha! What are you doing?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:17.560
Hurry up and transform!

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:21.350
How can you just calmly hand the Ideon over to the enemy?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:22.930
It'll be alright if we change its shape!

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.530
And take off our spacesuits!

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:26.730
Huh? Take off our spacesuits?

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:27.610
I see!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.940
To make them think that we've taken off!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:30.810
Yes.

00:15:30.810 --> 00:15:32.540
It's a miracle if everything goes well, though.

00:15:32.900 --> 00:15:34.460
Kasha! Take it off!

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:35.740
Yeah.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.990
This is the third machine!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:40.490
When we transform and leave, return the Carioca!

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:42.670
Roger! Make it fast!

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:50.490
We're doing the countdown!

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:51.380
Roger!

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.440
10...

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.520
9...

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:54.370
8...

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:55.050
7...

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:55.950
6...

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:56.910
5...

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:57.720
4...

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:58.780
3...

00:15:58.780 --> 00:15:59.550
2...

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:01.780
We're coming out, let go of the ship!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.610
Let go of the Logo Dau ship!

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.480
Did they really let us go?

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.710
I'll catch Sheryl and Karala!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:18.880
Thanks for releasing the hostages!

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.670
Enemy soldiers are boarding the Ideo-Nova.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:37.660
Good!

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:38.980
Force them to dock!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:41.360
Take care of the rest, okay?

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:43.410
If we make it through, see you again.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:51.760
What's going on?

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:53.900
Is it moving by remote control?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:54.610
No!

00:16:54.610 --> 00:16:56.290
Electromagnetic waves aren't being emitted!

00:16:58.320 --> 00:17:00.570
The Giant machine is
approaching from behind!

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:01.620
Is it docking?

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.140
We're docking!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.430
Okay!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.700
What's with this gauge? It turned on!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.500
That's the Ideo-Delta's cockpit!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.400
Doesn't forming the Giant make things easier for us?

00:17:28.250 --> 00:17:28.900
Damn you!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.050
Don't move!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:33.110
Kasha! We've taken the cockpit!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.300
Open the missile ports!

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:35.030
Let's go!

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:35.850
Roger!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.470
It turned into the Giant!

00:17:42.470 --> 00:17:44.540
The Giant is moving by our hands!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:59.000
Garaba's Zigg Mack has been destroyed!

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:01.600
Those damn aliens deceived us!

00:18:01.800 --> 00:18:04.320
Let's go! Solo Ship, cover us!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:09.930
Zurow Jicks, shower them with concentrated fire!

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:11.810
Our Zigg Mack will attack from below!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:13.490
The Solo Ship is closing in!

00:18:13.490 --> 00:18:14.770
Attack the enemy units!

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:17.040
All gun platforms and Glen Cannons! Fire!

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:24.740
The Ideon will go for the Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:26.550
Kasha! Take care of the fighters!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:30.460
Damn them! Their aim has gotten more accurate!

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:39.530
Cosmo! If we take any more
direct hits, we'll be destroyed!

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:40.260
What?

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.160
The barrier's weakening!

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.450
The Giant's movement is slowing down!

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:46.200
Launch a claw attack!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.690
Particle cannon, fire!

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:55.360
Below? They're coming from below?!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:02.770
Tear off one of the Giant's parts, then retreat!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:10.370
Pull out!

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.350
Damn Giant!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:12.970
Why won't it break down?!

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:18.150
I'm not like those other samurai!

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:20.810
I know the Zigg Mack inside out!

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:27.060
Cosmo! Do something!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.400
I know!

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.330
You won't get away!

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:52.680
The fighters?!

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.700
The Buff Clan didn't accept me either...

00:20:17.350 --> 00:20:18.330
Karala!

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.330
You threatened everyone and fled from our ship?

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:25.710
There are none among your companions
who want to flee from the Solo Ship.

00:20:26.570 --> 00:20:29.850
I desperately wanted to return to the Buff Clan.

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:31.410
It was you, as I expected!

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:33.720
You worthless alien woman!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.290
Kasha! Stop it!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.250
Why?!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.320
Thanks to Karala, I thought I was going to die!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:42.400
So did Cosmo, Moera and the others, right?

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:44.370
I'll accept any punishment...

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:45.380
Kasha...

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:50.950
Isn't it enough that we were saved?

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:03.990
Ms. Sheryl!

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:05.200
I'm entering!

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:05.680
Don't!

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:06.700
What's going on?

00:21:12.570 --> 00:21:14.300
What happened, Sheryl?

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:17.210
Did Karala really escape?

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:20.470
Karala, threatening all those people on her own?

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:23.190
Of course not.

00:21:23.710 --> 00:21:25.270
Then why did you lie like that?

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:29.490
Hatari and the others are necessary
crew members of the Solo Ship.

00:21:29.490 --> 00:21:32.280
What would happen if they
all came back like nothing happened?

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:34.910
All the runaways would be in a tight spot.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:38.780
And the entire Solo Ship would be unable to get along.

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:41.750
That's why we made Karala the scapegoat.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:42.970
I see...

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:45.650
Everyone would believe it since Karala's an alien.

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:46.380
Yes.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:48.750
If we hadn't done that, we'd have
fallen out amongst ourselves.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:53.220
If it wasn't for the others, I wouldn't have
made Karala put on this kind of act.

00:21:53.220 --> 00:21:57.260
Even if it required admitting I was
the ringleader of the runaways.

00:21:58.370 --> 00:21:59.810
Sheryl...

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.590
You'd go that far...

00:22:01.750 --> 00:22:03.540
Yes! I can't stand it!

00:22:03.540 --> 00:22:05.570
Even though I'm sick of fleeing through space,

00:22:05.570 --> 00:22:07.700
To owe a debt to Karala...

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:10.020
To Karala, of all people...

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.550
I'd rather die!

00:22:13.800 --> 00:22:17.490
The whole crew of the Solo
Ship is indebted to Karala.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:19.870
Damn it!

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:23.000
It's mortifying!

00:22:29.400 --> 00:22:34.150
The Solo Ship carries people with
 many different ways of thinking...

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.740
Yet the one keeping them together is the alien Karala.

00:22:39.740 --> 00:22:42.810
That fact makes them feel uncomfortable.

00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:56.720
<i>Disobeying Bes' orders,
Cosmo heads into battle against Buff Clan's life risking attack.</i>

00:22:56.890 --> 00:22:59.070
<i>The Solo Ship is forced into a desperate battle.</i>

00:22:59.560 --> 00:23:05.250
<i>Furthermore, Damido's meticulous plan puts the Ideon into danger.</i>

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>The deadly hook attack strikes the Ideon!</i>

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:14.730
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon: "Damido's Ultimate Strategy"</i>

